WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.070
Something wrong with the shuttle?

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.290
I'm not handing her over.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:18.900
Not to you, who would use her as a guinea pig, not to the likes of Second Earth...

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:21.070
I'm not handing her over.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:24.740
What kind of stunt is this, Han!? Violating orders is a serious offense!

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.410
What do you mean by that?

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:32.010
If it's to protect her, I don't care who I have to turn into an enemy!

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.710
I told you,

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.690
her and I are about to depart on our journey...

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:41.020
...to search for the promised land, where no one will bother us.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.360
Han! Why, you...!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.700
You'd be better off not trying anything foolish.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:53.700
I have the system in the palm of my hand, after all. And now, if you'll excuse me.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:57.710
Call Alpha back! We cannot allow the shuttle to launch!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:01.370
I've been trying to for some time, but I can't get through to them!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.970
Han! He's rigged it somehow!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.720
Main unit, come in! This is Scott!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.790
What's happening with the shuttle, main unit!?

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.740
What's going on at the shuttle!?

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.740
I don't know!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.070
We haven't been in contact with the main unit for a short while.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.700
This situation was not anticipated.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.010
Scott...

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:37.020
In any event, until new orders arrive, everyone maintain their front!

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.000
Still not yet!?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:03.040
Shuttle launch preparations complete. Commencing countdown.

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:04.480
One minute...

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.450
55...

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.320
50...

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.720
What!? What happened!?

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:26.700
Type II Trouble event. Power flow to linear catapult has dropped.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.740
Motion level can no longer be achieved.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:29.800
What!?

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.130
A malfunction of unknown cause has occurred

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.670
near the 10th level underground power reactor.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.240
Unknown cause!? Damn!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.330
Too bad, huh Han?

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:02.700
Do you think you can get the system back to normal without me?

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:06.210
Right now carrying out this mission takes priority! Come on!

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:57.020
It's not just the catapult. Power supplies all over the base are unstable.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:00.030
What's this happening here?

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.250
Marlene...

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.620
There's something there!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.380
W- what!?

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:23.710
A Blue drawing electricity directly from a machine?

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:27.410
You're telling me it's using electricity for its functional energy?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.720
Impossible...

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.950
This can't be possible!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.000
More new Blue!?

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:45.130
Commander, requesting instructions! Commander!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.670
What are you doing!? You have to do something quick!

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:57.010
This cannot be... this sort of pattern wasn't in our reports...

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.520
This sort of...

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.520
Dammit!

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:02.180
Idiot! You can't use a gun!

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:05.020
If you attack that thing wrong and damage the power reactor, then what do we do!?

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.860
Well, what would you have us do!?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.720
What's the matter!? The Attackers have suddenly...

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:36.320
The part unit governing the Attackers just died.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:37.980
They can't be used any longer.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:42.000
What did you say!? So what's going to happen to Marlene and the others!?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:48.330
How... how can something like this... be!? Those bugs...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.000
Son of a bitch!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:54.010
W- what are you doing!? Let me go!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:58.340
Aren't you listening!? It's especially times like this when we must think calmly!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.670
You guys control yourselves too!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.680
You're the one who's not thinking!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.680
While we're doing this, what if something happens to Marlene and the others fighting out there!? Let go!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:11.350
- Someone has to do something! Let go!
- Get off me! We have a strategy of our own!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.160
You're going to pay!

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:20.720
You don't think you'll pay for what you did to my girl!?

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:38.980
You'll pay! Whoever you are, if you get in my way...!

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.990
What are you doing, Han!? Come back!

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:43.680
Pull him off of it!

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:47.660
Don't come near me!

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:49.660
I won't let anyone interfere!

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:54.000
Han! Have you lost your senses!? Do you intend to disobey even more orders!?

00:08:54.070 --> 00:09:00.670
Shut up! You guys are all alike! Whatever suits you, military orders...

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:06.010
- you're nothing more than vermin to see everything in those terms!

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:12.140
How are they Samples!? How are they guinea pigs!? She is just like us!!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.700
S- Stop him!

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.360
But, if we provoke it the wrong way...

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:29.030
She's a human, with the same red blood flowing through her as us!

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:30.400
And yet...

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:35.640
And yet, am I right? All that waits for her are ruins and bugs, and your egos!

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:40.310
You, who would cast her out into a world more rotten than Hell itself,

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:45.980
and carve her up with the tainted blade that is reality!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.990
Do you think she would be happy with something like that!?

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.990
Don't you feel sorry for the Sleepers!?

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:58.660
I will protect you! I will... I will...

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:03.670
For her life! For her peace of mind! For her future!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.210
You'll pay! You'll pay for this!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.760
The power supply system has sustained about 40% damage.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:10.330
It looks as though we can use one block of Supporters,

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:14.000
but the problem is whether or not I can reboot the catapult.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:18.340
Is this any time to be saying something so carefree? There's a manual, isn't there!?

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:21.010
Yeah, but...

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.350
The shuttle launch has top priority! Do something!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:27.350
Yes, sir.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.020
Where are you going!?

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:32.020
I'm going to go help Marlene!

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:36.690
I told you that unauthorized actions were not permitted! We're getting on the shuttle.

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:38.030
What did you say!?

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:42.400
It sounds cold-hearted, but we have to have them buy time for us.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:46.030
With our current capabilities as they are, we can't afford to assist them!

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:49.700
No way! I'm going by myself to save Marlene!

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.410
Without any Armor Shrikes, what do you intend to do!?

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.380
- The Supporters.
- What!?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.010
Han was saying, wasn't he,

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:05.720
that the Supporters can accept manual voice input? Them!

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.730
That's insane! They aren't even built for combat!

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.730
That's okay, give them a chance!

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:13.060
Don't you get it!?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.400
You are a precious Sample!

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:18.730
If you die on us, the whole meaning of this operation is lost!

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:23.400
If we were to lose our Sample, it would be my responsibility!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.380
You got that, kid!?

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:38.250
Do I care about that!?

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.020
I...

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.490
I'm going to fight!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:48.700
Do it!

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.930
The Supporters! Hurry up!

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.100
I have nothing to do with this!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.790
You're not about to go on me!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.920
Insect bastards...

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.280
How many rounds are left?

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.660
This is it, huh?

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:06.370
- ene! Mar...!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:07.570
Marlene!

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:12.710
Yuji!?

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:17.050
Do you read me, Marlene!? Which way are you headed now?

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:20.710
I can now use the Supporters! Just hold on!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.720
Hold on? What for!?

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:27.960
The shuttle preparations are almost finished. We can nearly blast off.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:30.090
So, hang in there!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.150
The shuttle...?

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:38.560
The Supporters can continue operating on their reserve power source.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:42.010
But whether or not the catapult will work correctly...

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:46.440
In any case, hurry! If our front line is broken through, it's all over!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.350
You fool! Get back to the shuttle! Don't worry about me!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.010
But why!?

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.020
Why do you think we've come all this way?

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:59.620
If you were to die on us, the whole meaning of this mission would be lost!

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:03.250
I'm well prepared to risk my life for it!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.040
No way!

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:15.700
What do you mean, prepared? You're the one who doesn't understand!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.710
I...

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.370
I...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.940
I want to go into space together with you!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:29.020
From 30 to 50, start attack enemies!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:34.960
22 stop!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.330
Marlene!

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:42.000
Yuji...

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.560
Come on, Marlene!

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:47.540
Come on!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:08.720
This is the surviving assembled Asian area forces.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:12.690
We have successfully taken off from Baikonur Space Base.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:15.020
We are accommodating two Samples.

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:18.720
We will be late arriving at the Station, in 10 more minutes.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.290
We've barely made it this far.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.500
Request that you cordially receive us.

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:49.990
Yuji...

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:54.000
Hm? What is it? Are your injuries hurting you?

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.830
No... maybe a little...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:05.010
Between the ruins, and those monstrous bugs, and fighting,

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:10.350
there was nothing but awful things taking place on the ground, but...

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:14.010
we survived through it, both of us.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.350
Yeah.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.360
What happens now?

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:19.690
That would be...

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:24.360
I know. But I...

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.800
Even so...

00:20:11.750 --> 00:21:08.460
Yuji!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:39.880
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:46.010
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:55.160
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.280 --> 00:22:01.330
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:07.750
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:14.940
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:20.100
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:26.160
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:32.440
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:39.920
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:46.780
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:54.030
I've failed in my duty?

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:57.100
I'm the one who allowed Yuji to participate in combat.

00:22:57.180 --> 00:23:01.510
As a result, the fact is that I am to blame for allowing him to become injured.

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:04.520
However, I was by no means in error.

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:06.980
Yuji and I fought together, and saved each other,

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.850
and escaped from that hell.

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:12.550
Yet even so... Yuji!
